# ORIB project

ORIB is a Manifest V3 content script. `classic.css` and `renderer.js` are injected into `www.reddit.com` at `document_start`. There is no bundler, package manager, framework, or test runner.

- Edit `renderer.js`, `classic.css`, and `manifest.json` in place.
- Do not add dependencies or a build step for a small change.
- Keep the UI on the old-Reddit system in `DESIGN.md`.
- Route in `initClassicReddit`. Ready pages set `html` id `classic-reddit-ready`. Paths that must stay on Reddit (`/chat`, `/settings`, `/poll`, `/mod`, `/message`) set `classic-bypass` and return.
- When committing, use Conventional Commits: `fix: keep subreddit css when purging styles`.

```js
// ❌ BAD — new stack for a content script
import { h } from "preact";

// ✅ GOOD — same pattern as the rest of renderer.js
document.body.innerHTML = html;
document.documentElement.id = "classic-reddit-ready";
```
